DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
44898::$$$message_0397_0000_0000$$$::"And so we beat my big sister. Then we drugged her, packed her into a coffin, shipped it to the Association...and now we're at the onsen."::
44899::$$$message_0397_0000_0001$$$::"Mixed bathing!? Are you kidding me!?"::
44900::$$$message_0397_0000_0002$$$::"Now that's rare to see in this day and age. Whoever built this place has good taste."::
44901::$$$message_0397_0000_0003$$$::"Ah, yes. Gender equality. By the way, Lancer, shouldn't you at least bring a towel? It's the bare minimum of good manners to wear one around your waist."::
44902::$$$message_0397_0000_0004$$$::"Oh, sorry. It slipped my mind because it's been so long. You're not supposed to wear swimsuits, either. It's not like you have anything to hide as a man."::
44903::$$$message_0397_0000_0005$$$::"Of course, I didn't bring anything so uncivilized with me. Swimsuits are a sacrilege against onsen.[wvl canskip=false time=200][hffacechg2 chara=セイバーprt face=喜 pos=winner time=400 textclear=0][hfsigh layer=2] Right, Ayaka?"::
44904::$$$message_0397_0000_0006$$$::"Y-you two...[wvl canskip=false time=200][hffacechg2 chara=綾香 face=驚き3 pos=winner time=400 textclear=0] No, never mind you, Lancer. Saber!? Are you really okay with this!?[wvl][hfwww layer=2] It's a mixed bath! Do you understand what means!?"::
44905::$$$message_0397_0000_0007$$$::"I know it means this bathhouse doesn't have separate baths for men and women. I've heard the custom dates back to Japan's Edo period."::
44906::$$$message_0397_0000_0008$$$::"Yup. Well, I'm off to the dressing room. Don't take too long.[wvl canskip=false time=200][hffacechg2 chara=ランサーprt face=喜 pos=winner time=300 textclear=0][hfpop layer=2] The onsen is supposed to be our reward. Don't let it go to waste, all right?"::
44907::$$$message_0397_0000_0009$$$::"Y-you're right, but...!"::
44908::$$$message_0397_0000_0010$$$::"Ayaka. A lord should properly reward one's subjects. I shouldn't have to explain that it is the mark of a first-rate Master."::
44909::$$$message_0397_0000_0011$$$::"W-w-wha..."::
44910::$$$message_0397_0000_0012$$$::"Well, I'll be going ahead, too. Now, let's take off our clothes and go into the bath."::
44911::$$$message_0397_0000_0013$$$::"Guh! Saber, you idiot! I can't believe you guys finally decided to get along with each other [font italic=true]now[font italic=false]!"::
44912::$$$message_0397_0000_0014$$$::(But the way things are going, this is not good! Think, Ayaka! I don't think there's any way to avoid the mixed bath... In that case...[wvl canskip=false time=200][hffacechg2 chara=綾香 face=驚き2 pos=winner time=300 textclear=0][hfchance layer=2]I know!)::
44913::$$$message_0397_0000_0015$$$::"Wait, time out, you two! I need to use the bath first, so don't go in yet!"::
44914::$$$message_0397_0000_0016$$$::"Huh? Sure, I don't mind."::
44915::$$$message_0397_0000_0017$$$::"Neither do I. We can just go in after you."::
44916::$$$message_0397_0000_0018$$$::"Th-those beasts! ...Hmph! But this is matter of life or death. Just you watch, this is how I'll fight back!"::
44917::$$$message_0397_0000_0019$$$::"I-is that even allowed!?"::
44918::$$$message_0397_0000_0020$$$::"Phew, dodged that bullet... 'Build a wall separating men's and women's baths' was a pretty silly thing to use my wish on, but this has been one big silly adventure."::
44919::$$$message_0397_0000_0021$$$::"I'm pretty sure I'm wishing within my means, at least."::
44920::$$$message_0397_0000_0022$$$::"Hot damn, girls really are strongest at the eleventh hour...[wvl canskip=false time=200][hffacechg2 chara=ランサーprt face=困惑 pos=winner time=400 textclear=0] What now, Sir Knight? You gonna leave things half-finished when the prize was right under your nose?"::
44921::$$$message_0397_0000_0023$$$::"...Lancer. No matter how noble we try to frame it, we are weapons. The Noble Phantasms we wield are meant to destroy, not save."::
44922::$$$message_0397_0000_0024$$$::"Yeah. Okay, let's demolish it."::
44923::$$$message_0397_0000_0025$$$::"Let's."::
44924::$$$message_0397_0000_0026$$$::"Hey! I can hear you two! What do you think you're doing!?"::
44925::$$$message_0397_0000_0027$$$::"On my mark, then. Even a wall built by the Holy Grail shouldn't be able to withstand two Noble Phantasms at once..."[skip_next_tag][br]::
44926::$$$message_0397_0000_0028$$$::"Hold it! And you call yourselves heroes!? Learn to consider a bashful girl's feelings!"::
44927::$$$message_0397_0000_0029$$$::"Fools, go take a cold shower and reflect on what you're doing! Bedroom hijinks are private matters, but this is the onsen! A place of open and honorable mingling between the sexes!"::
44928::$$$message_0397_0000_0030$$$::"What..."::
44929::$$$message_0397_0000_0031$$$::"...did he say?"::
44930::$$$message_0397_0000_0032$$$::"A bride's bare body is meant to be seen [font italic=true]after[font italic=false] wedding vows have been exchanged! I, the King of Heroes, will not allow you to destroy this wall without Ayaka's consent!"::
44931::$$$message_0397_0000_0033$$$::"Sit down, insolent knaves! [wvl][hfwww layer=2]You'll tarnish Ayaka's purity over my dead body!"::
44932::$$$message_0397_0000_0034$$$::"W-what a straight shooter aura! I can't believe what I'm hearing! Are you Ayaka's mother or something!?"::
44933::$$$message_0397_0000_0035$$$::"At least call me her big brother! I try to play the part of her reliable upperclassman from college!"::
44934::$$$message_0397_0000_0036$$$::"Uh, then that makes me a struggling neighborhood host. I'll be the maiden's high school upperclassman."::
44935::$$$message_0397_0000_0037$$$::"What...what about me? Rider is in the same year as her, so what other positions are still open?"::
44936::$$$message_0397_0000_0038$$$::"Hmm...[wvl canskip=false time=200][hffacechg2 chara=アーチャーprt face=喜 pos=winner time=400 textclear=0][hfsigh layer=2] What about a blond exchange student doing a homestay at the Sajyou house?"::
44937::$$$message_0397_0000_0039$$$::"Oh, I like that. Why don't I act mysterious and bad at Japanese, when I'm actually royalty? I think I'm well suited for the role."::
44938::$$$message_0397_0000_0040$$$::"Urgh... As much as I hate to admit it, you're right.[wvl canskip=false time=400][hffacechg2 chara=セイバーprt face=笑顔 pos=winner time=400 textclear=0] This could be interesting, so let's think about the backstory a little more. Who would Ayaka be in this scenario?"::
44939::$$$message_0397_0000_0041$$$::"I said I can still hear you.... Well, looks like somebody's having fun. Are we sure they aren't actually buddies?"::
44940::$$$message_0397_0000_0042$$$::"...That makes me the odd one out.[wvl canskip=false time=200][hffacechg2 chara=綾香 face=喜2 pos=winner time=400 textclear=0][hfsigh layer=2][se storage=SE_0006.wav] ...I guess it's fine. This bath is nice, and it feels like I'm on vacation. I'm glad we came."::
44941::$$$message_0397_0000_0043$$$::"...Yeah. We might be from another world, but it's nice to do this once in a while, Dad..."::
44942::$$$message_0397_0000_0044$$$::"By the way, Ayaka, why were you so eager to do this when you dislike fighting? Did you want to visit an onsen that badly?"::
44943::$$$message_0397_0000_0045$$$::"Hm? I don't really hate fighting. I just don't like scary things happening to me."::
44944::$$$message_0397_0000_0046$$$::"Huh?"::
44945::$$$message_0397_0000_0047$$$::"We fought a lot of people and won, as expected. It's like Archer said: we're veterans."::
44946::$$$message_0397_0000_0048$$$::"I was confident we wouldn't lose to anyone other than my sister. After all, everyone needs to be the ones taking lessons from us."::
44947::$$$message_0397_0000_0049$$$::"..."::
44948::$$$message_0397_0000_0050$$$::"..."::
44949::$$$message_0397_0000_0051$$$::"...I know what you're all thinking. Yeah.[wvl canskip=false time=200][hffacechg2 chara=セイバーprt face=哀 pos=winner time=400 textclear=0][hfsweat layer=2 ox=-20 oy=50] I'll be the one to say it. Ayaka scares me the most."{��